  "description": "Best for open maps like Dry Arabia or High View.\n\nGameplan:\n- get safely to 2TC (react to initial push)\n- take sacred sites\n- (optional) wall sacred sites (e.g. wall far ones, keep army in the middle)\n- mass units\n- \"naturally\" age up with compound of the defender\n- build keeps EVERYWHERE\n\nDo not use scholars to fight until past age III!",
